---
{
  "layout": "layout.njk",
  "permalink": "explore.html",
  "title": "Connected heritage · Sanatan Heritage",
  "description": "Follow connections between illustrated stories, divine forms, scriptures and Sanskrit vocabulary.",
  "bodyClass": "references-page explore-page",
  "ogType": "website",
  "ogImage": "og.png",
  "ogImageAlt": "Sanatan Heritage — Stories, Wisdom, Traditions",
  "sourceLink": "sources.html#stories",
  "scripts": [
    "/assets/js/explorer.js"
  ]
}
---
<main id="main" data-pagefind-body><section class="reference-intro"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Connected heritage</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW A THREAD</p><h1>One story.<br><em>A wider world.</em></h1><p>Choose a question, then follow the connections. Each doorway leads to a page you can read now.</p></section>
<section class="section explorer"><div class="explorer-controls" hidden><label for="journey-choice">What draws you in?</label><select id="journey-choice"><option value="all">All journeys</option>{% for journey in journeys %}<option value="{{ journey.id }}">{{ journey.title }}</option>{% endfor %}</select><p id="journey-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
{% for journey in journeys %}<article class="journey-panel" data-journey="{{ journey.id }}" id="journey-{{ journey.id }}"><p class="eyebrow">A CONNECTED JOURNEY</p><h2>{{ journey.title }}</h2><p>{{ journey.description }}</p><ol class="journey-links"><li><span>01 / THE STORY</span><a href="{{ journey.story.href }}">{{ journey.story.title }}</a></li><li><span>02 / THE DIVINE FORM</span><a href="{{ journey.deity.href }}">{{ journey.deity.title }}</a></li><li><span>03 / THE TEXT</span><a href="{{ journey.scripture.href }}">{{ journey.scripture.title }}</a></li><li><span>04 / WORDS TO KNOW</span>{% for term in journey.terms %}<a href="{{ term.href }}">{{ term.title }}</a>{% endfor %}</li></ol><a class="source-link" href="{{ journey.source }}">Sources for this journey</a></article>{% endfor %}
</section></main>
